error[E010]: app name `Orders_App` is not DNS-safe
  ┌─ e010-bad-names.yaml:2:7
  │
2 │ name: Orders_App
  │       ^^^^^^^^^^ use only lowercase letters, digits and `-`
  │
  = help: names become AWS resource names; try `orders-app`

error[E010]: service name `API` is not DNS-safe
  ┌─ e010-bad-names.yaml:4:3
  │
4 │   API:
  │   ^^^ use only lowercase letters, digits and `-`
  │
  = help: names become AWS resource names; try `api`

error[E010]: queue name `jobs--high` is not DNS-safe
  ┌─ e010-bad-names.yaml:7:3
  │
7 │   jobs--high:
  │   ^^^^^^^^^^ names cannot contain `--`
  │
  = help: names become AWS resource names; try `jobs-high`

